%%% note
由来: mulet test/mulet/io_test.clj:193 (readXml-externalEntities-test)
testing: externalEntities true — allows external entities (but won't fail on simple XML)
元の形: io/readXml の直接呼び出しを DW に書き換え
mulet: 成功
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
---
read("<root><item>hello</item></root>", "application/xml", {"externalEntities": true})
%%% output application/json
{
  "root": {
    "item": "hello"
  }
}
